1
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,800
Time can dissolve all obsessions.

2
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,980
Years can heal all wounds in the world.

3
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,560
But for me,

4
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,960
after a thousand years,

5
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,600
only the old wound in my heart

6
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,060
has never scabbed over

7
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,860
and never faded.

8
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,240
Help me.

9
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,100
Stop.

10
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:41,680
Stop.

11
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,300
Tang'er.

12
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,780
I thought the memories sealed deep in time

13
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,420
had long vanished with the wind.

14
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:04,590
But at the slightest touch,

15
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:06,440
regret,

16
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,460
guilt,

17
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:11,060
and remorse

18
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:14,220
surge up

19
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:16,980
and swallow me whole.

20
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,120
Who are you?

21
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:29,320
I am the messenger who judges good and evil

22
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,960
and ferries souls.

23
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:32,660
Soul.

24
00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:34,060
Where is Tang'er's soul?

25
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:35,940
Can I see her one more time?

26
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,560
She was pure and virtuous in life,

27
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,820
and now rests in peace.

28
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:42,380
But you have committed too much slaughter just now,

29
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:43,600
making you unable to reincarnate,

30
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:46,060
and you will never see her again in this life.

31
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:49,039
However, throughout your mortal life,

32
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:50,420
you kept kindness in your heart,

33
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:51,039
so I

34
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:53,800
can give you a chance to see her again.

35
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:57,420
I am willing to try, no matter the cost.

36
00:01:58,259 --> 00:02:00,720
You will endure boundless loneliness day and night,

37
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,080
and eternal torment.

38
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,200
Are you still willing?

39
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,860
Even if it means eternal torment,

40
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:09,820
as long as there is a sliver of hope to see her again,

41
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,540
I will have no regrets.

42
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,610
Since this is what your heart desires,

43
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,000
come with me.

44
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,940
From today on,

45
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,440
Chen Yao is dead,

46
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:26,240
and your past self is gone from this world.

47
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,579
You will serve under the Day and Night Wandering Gods,

48
00:02:28,579 --> 00:02:31,160
and become a soul ferryman.

49
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:32,940
Using one's own pain

50
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:35,740
to warn the world that actions have consequences.

51
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:37,160
In the long years,

52
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:38,940
only by staying true to oneself

53
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:40,180
and fulfilling one's duties

54
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:42,400
can one wait for the chance

55
00:02:42,820 --> 00:02:46,140
to see the one they yearn for again.

56
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,640
Bastard, let me go.

57
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:52,660
Okay.

58
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:53,880
As you wish.

59
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,840
Save my daughter.

60
00:04:40,620 --> 00:04:41,980
I've searched for you for five years.

61
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:43,780
You actually showed up on your own.

62
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,440
That saves me a lot of trouble.

63
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,020
I beg you, save my daughter.

64
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,520
I'll do anything you ask.

65
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,200
I was just one step away

66
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:20,160
from avenging my father.

67
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:34,940
Mumu.

68
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:36,640
A dream.

69
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,420
It's a dream.

70
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,300
How can a dream feel so real?

71
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:08,900
It's been five years.

72
00:06:09,460 --> 00:06:11,160
I finally got this chance.

73
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:15,560
I will personally send you to prison

74
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:18,360
and clear my father's name.

75
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,630
Morning, Lawyer Gu.

76
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,760
The same.

77
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,300
Sorry, Lawyer Gu.

78
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,760
Sorry, Lawyer Gu.

79
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:46,560
Watch where you're going.

80
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,400
Sorry.

81
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,420
Thank you, Lawyer Gu.

82
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:55,080
Be careful.

83
00:06:58,760 --> 00:06:59,860
Be careful.

84
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:11,460
Everything is the same.

85
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:18,020
Then right now,

86
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:20,960
Lingze should be in my office.

87
00:07:31,860 --> 00:07:34,320
Mr. Ling, why are you here?

88
00:07:36,159 --> 00:07:37,090
Waiting for you.

89
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,100
If you need anything, just let me know.

90
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:41,159
I would have gone to you.

91
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,620
Why did you come in person?

92
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:46,400
How are the preparations for the trial?

93
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:47,600
Everything is ready.

94
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:49,540
That's good.

95
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,060
There's one more thing

96
00:07:58,460 --> 00:07:59,540
I need your help with.

97
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:00,200
Go ahead.

98
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,930
Right before the trial,

99
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:05,880
go get the evidence of Mu Cheng blackmailing me.

100
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:09,020
If Mu Cheng doesn't cooperate during the trial,

101
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,820
expose this evidence.

102
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:13,040
As for the rest,

103
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:15,990
I don't need to teach you what to do, right?

104
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:18,920
I really came back to this day.

105
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,200
December 1st.

106
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:22,380
The Mu Cheng case goes to trial today.

107
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:23,560
An influencer with tens of millions of followers

108
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:26,720
and the entertainment giant Ling Group are officially on trial.

109
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,980
The case uncovered the massive tips in livestreams

110
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:30,920
and the dark truth of illegal transactions behind them.

111
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,179
Is it the artist's moral failure,

112
00:08:32,179 --> 00:08:35,220
or did Ling Group condone it for profit?

113
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:37,740
The red line of internet traffic must not be crossed.

114
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:40,870
This trial of the empire has the whole city's attention.

115
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,770
I accuse the boss of Ling Media,

116
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:44,300
Ling Ze.

117
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:48,100
He threatened and forced me

118
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:50,540
to sell my body.

119
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,580
Mr. Wang.

120
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:52,100
Mr. Ling, Mr. Ling.

121
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:53,580
Every time after my livestream ended,

122
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:54,260
Come.

123
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:55,720
he would use celebrating as an excuse

124
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,020
to take me to nightclubs to relax.

125
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:57,620
I finally get to see you in person.

126
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:58,620
Come, have a seat.

127
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,240
Then,

128
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:05,240
he also made me accompany investors.

129
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:14,200
Let me go.

130
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,080
The plaintiff defamed the defendant

131
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,740
and extorted them.

132
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,700
You're talking nonsense.

133
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,600
I have the plaintiff's transfer records here.

134
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,800
It is clear from this

135
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,540
that before having relations with the investor,

136
00:09:30,540 --> 00:09:33,400
the plaintiff had already received his transfers.

137
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,730
This is a conspiracy orchestrated by her.

138
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:38,260
What is going on?

139
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,420
There's new evidence.

140
00:09:39,420 --> 00:09:40,080
Your Honor.

141
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:43,480
I am the investor Wang mentioned by the plaintiff.

142
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:47,540
I can prove that everything the defendant said is true.

143
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:50,720
It was Mucheng who took the initiative to get close to me.

144
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,250
She wanted to use tricks to bring down Ling's.

145
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,080
Xingcan.

146
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:00,740
Let me go.

147
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,700
He has already forged evidence of you blackmailing him.

148
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:06,230
You can't win this lawsuit.

149
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:08,270
What did you say?

150
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:09,700
Work with me.

151
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,200
I have a way to get your freedom back.

152
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,330
Have you decided

153
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,800
what reward you want?

154
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:36,200
I want...

155
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,260
You.

156
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:07,870
Killing you would be letting you off too easy.

157
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:11,100
I will bring you to justice

158
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:13,100
and make you suffer in prison.

159
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,700
I got the stuff. See you at the bridge.

160
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:28,520
This

161
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:31,180
contains all the evidence of Lingze's crimes.

162
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:31,910
Keep it safe.

163
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,260
Appear in court at dawn tomorrow.

164
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:38,700
With this,

165
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,600
we can definitely bring Lingze to justice.

166
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:43,910
Let's go. I'll take you back first.

167
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,240
What's wrong?

168
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:55,640
You.

169
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,640
Let me go.

170
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,180
Let me go.

171
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,040
Got it.

172
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:37,240
Get the job done.

173
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:39,500
You can name your reward.

174
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:43,700
Since God gave me a second chance,

175
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,600
I must not fail this time.

176
00:12:47,220 --> 00:12:48,800
Okay, okay, I'm already here.

177
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:49,840
I'll be right up.

178
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:51,460
No problem. No problem.
